# Frontend Environment Variables Example

# URL of the Backend API (deployed on GCP VM or locally)
# For local development: http://localhost:8080/api
# For production: https://api.climb.yourdomain.com/api
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api

# Google Maps API Key (Required for Phase 8+)
# Enable Maps JavaScript API & Places API in GCP Console
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key
